     </rect>
    </property>
    <property name="text">
     <string>The decoder can be used in the following modes:
- Swith decoder
- Swith decoder plus (has an Emergency board)
- Servo decoder
- Relais decoder for 4 relais
- Relais decoder for 16 relais
- Safety decoder with Watchdog
- Liftdecoder
- Function</string>
    </property>
